p.src:
A compact editorial summary of the spoken logic is $\text{daily conduct}
\longrightarrow
\text{reputation}
\longrightarrow
\text{future opportunities}.$ This is not a spoken formula, but it preserves the point faithfully. We are not judged only in formal interviews. We are judged in repeated contact, under ordinary conditions, by how we carry ourselves when the stakes seem low.

